HASRAT BHARI NIGAH SE DEKHTI RAHI MADAR<br>
GALE PE ASGHAR-E-MASOOM KE CHALA KHANJAR<br>
<br>
Kabhi na bhule gi madar wo dard ka manzar<br>
Wo lena hichkiyan shiddat ki pyas se ro kar<br>
Laga hai seene se khaime mein jo rahi muztar<br>
Raha zuban pe sada haye ay Ali Asghar<br>
<br>
Zameen-e-Karbobala kyun na tujh ko raas aye<br>
Abhi na godh ki garmi bhi khatm ho paye<br>
Jo kam sini mein mere laal tujh ko maut aye<br>
Teri judaye mein marjaye gi teri madar<br>
<br>
Nikalne paye na armaan koi aye beta<br>
Tujhe to ghutniyon chalna bhi na naseeb huwa<br>
Na bhul paye gi madar kabi ye dagh tera<br>
Mila na pani ka khatra tujhe mere dilbar<br>
<br>
Wo tishnagi se tardapna tumhara ro ro ke<br>
Ye khushk hoton pe qurban aye mere bache<br>
Hai mere ab bhi taswwur mein bas wohi lamha<br>
Diya hai dagh mere laal ye mujhe kyu kar<br>
<br>
Mai tujh ko seene se apne laga ke layee thi<br>
Na dur hone di khud se mai ek pal bhi kabhi<br>
Bala ke dasht mein meri ujard gaye goodi<br>
Suhaag ujard gaya mai lut gaye yahan aakar<br>
<br>
Fugha ye karti thi Bano Sohail lashe par<br>
Bhala mai jeeke karun kya bata Ali Asghar<br>
Zameen-e-garm pe tum sogaye mere dilbar<br>
Na pyas Qasim-o-Abbas na Ali Akber<br>

